{"id":"fb7f59b6fc58cf0a","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle.md","title":"Toyama 三步环的内部见证","display":"ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle — Toyama 三步环的内部见证","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle","aliases":["56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle"],"display":"ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle — Toyama 三步环的内部见证","depends_on":["[[56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating]]","[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]"],"reconstructed":"2026-10-19","reconstruction_basis":"supplied-book-56-files","historical_record_status":"original-record-not-supplied"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle — Toyama 三步环的内部见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69109041e60f84f6\" href=\"?note=69109041e60f84f6\" title=\"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating\">56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"reconstruction_basis","html":"supplied-book-56-files"},{"key":"historical_record_status","html":"original-record-not-supplied"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69109041e60f84f6\" href=\"?note=69109041e60f84f6\" title=\"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating\">56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating</a> 中互异的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T,R_0,R_1,a,t_0,t_1,t_2,\\gamma\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T,R_0,R_1,a,t_0,t_1,t_2,\\gamma\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=R_0\\cup R_1\">\\(R=R_0\\cup R_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_R\">\\(\\mathcal E_R\\)</span> 及其位置、子项、替换接口采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon=()\">\\(\\varepsilon=()\\)</span> 是空位置序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1)\">\\((1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2)\">\\((2)\\)</span> 分别是长度为一的位置序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in S,\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in V\\quad\n\\sigma(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf0,&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\mathbf1,&amp;z=y,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\},\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\tau(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&amp;z=x,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\in V\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma,\\tau\\in S,\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in V\\quad\n\\sigma(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf0,&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\mathbf1,&amp;z=y,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\},\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\tau(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&amp;z=x,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\in V\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u_0\\coloneqq((1),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_1\\coloneqq((2),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),y),\\qquad\nu_2\\coloneqq(\\varepsilon,\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x),\\mathsf F(x,x,x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u_0\\coloneqq((1),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_1\\coloneqq((2),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),y),\\qquad\nu_2\\coloneqq(\\varepsilon,\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x),\\mathsf F(x,x,x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol u\\coloneqq\\{(0,u_0),(1,u_1),(2,u_2)\\},\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\{0,1,2\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol u\\coloneqq\\{(0,u_0),(1,u_1),(2,u_2)\\},\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\{0,1,2\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nt_0|_{(1)}&amp;=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&amp;\nt_0[x\\sigma]_{(1)}&amp;=t_1,\\\\\nt_1|_{(2)}&amp;=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&amp;\nt_1[y\\sigma]_{(2)}&amp;=t_2,\\\\\nt_2|_{\\varepsilon}&amp;=\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x)\\tau=t_2,&amp;\nt_2[\\mathsf F(x,x,x)\\tau]_{\\varepsilon}&amp;=t_0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nt_0|_{(1)}&amp;=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&amp;\nt_0[x\\sigma]_{(1)}&amp;=t_1,\\\\\nt_1|_{(2)}&amp;=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&amp;\nt_1[y\\sigma]_{(2)}&amp;=t_2,\\\\\nt_2|_{\\varepsilon}&amp;=\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x)\\tau=t_2,&amp;\nt_2[\\mathsf F(x,x,x)\\tau]_{\\varepsilon}&amp;=t_0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t_0,u_0,t_1)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_1,u_1,t_2)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_2,u_2,t_0)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t_0,u_0,t_1)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_1,u_1,t_2)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_2,u_2,t_0)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\gamma(n),\\boldsymbol u(n\\bmod3),\\gamma(n+1))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\gamma(n),\\boldsymbol u(n\\bmod3),\\gamma(n+1))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Terminating}(T,\\to).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Terminating}(T,\\to).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>全替换函数、合法位置及具体步三元组给出可直接核验的三步环见证。两个分量各自终止的断言及其论证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69109041e60f84f6\" href=\"?note=69109041e60f84f6\" title=\"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating\">56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating</a>；该反例的规则、签名与结论均沿用这一内部节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"69109041e60f84f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"69109041e60f84f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating]] 中互异的 $x,y$、$\\Sigma,V,T,R_0,R_1,a,t_0,t_1,t_2,\\gamma$ 和 $\\to$，令 $R=R_0\\cup R_1$。$\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$\\mathcal E_R$ 及其位置、子项、替换接口采用 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]。$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\varepsilon=()$ 是空位置序列，$(1)$、$(2)$ 分别是长度为一的位置序列。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating]] 中互异的 $x,y$、$\\Sigma,V,T,R_0,R_1,a,t_0,t_1,t_2,\\gamma$ 和 $\\to$，令 $R=R_0\\cup R_1$。$\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$\\mathcal E_R$ 及其位置、子项、替换接口采用 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]。$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\varepsilon=()$ 是空位置序列，$(1)$、$(2)$ 分别是长度为一的位置序列。","embed":false},{"target":"56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"69109041e60f84f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"全替换函数、合法位置及具体步三元组给出可直接核验的三步环见证。两个分量各自终止的断言及其论证见 [[56-ex-disjoint-union-not-terminating]]；该反例的规则、签名与结论均沿用这一内部节点。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,T,R_0,R_1,a,t_0,t_1,t_2,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"R=R_0\\cup R_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_R","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon=()","display":false},{"tex":"(1)","display":false},{"tex":"(2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in S,\\qquad\n\\forall z\\in V\\quad\n\\sigma(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf0,&z=x,\\\\\n\\mathbf1,&z=y,\\\\\nz,&z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\},\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\tau(z)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\na,&z=x,\\\\\nz,&z\\in V\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"u_0\\coloneqq((1),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_1\\coloneqq((2),\\mathsf{or}(x,y),y),\\qquad\nu_2\\coloneqq(\\varepsilon,\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x),\\mathsf F(x,x,x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol u\\coloneqq\\{(0,u_0),(1,u_1),(2,u_2)\\},\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\{0,1,2\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nt_0|_{(1)}&=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&\nt_0[x\\sigma]_{(1)}&=t_1,\\\\\nt_1|_{(2)}&=\\mathsf{or}(x,y)\\sigma=a,&\nt_1[y\\sigma]_{(2)}&=t_2,\\\\\nt_2|_{\\varepsilon}&=\\mathsf F(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,x)\\tau=t_2,&\nt_2[\\mathsf F(x,x,x)\\tau]_{\\varepsilon}&=t_0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(t_0,u_0,t_1)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_1,u_1,t_2)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\n\\land(t_2,u_2,t_0)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\gamma(n),\\boldsymbol u(n\\bmod3),\\gamma(n+1))\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Terminating}(T,\\to).","display":true}],"bytes":2547,"backlinks":[{"id":"69109041e60f84f6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"由本文件的规则与位置替换可以逐步核验所列三步环；其显式位置及替换见证见内部节点 [[56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle]]。这些见证证明三个具体步，不依赖未提供的脚本或输出。两个分量 SN 是原书练习；本地证明如下。R₁ 每步选择一个真子项，项大小严格下降。R₀ 的规则保持被改写子项的根符号，变量和常元不归约。某 F 节点一旦根收缩，三个新子项最初相同，此后它们的根各自保持相同，因此不可能再次同时成为 0、1 和任意项，故该根至多收缩一次。按项高度归纳：根收缩前后都只有有限个严格较低高度的子项归约，根自身至多一步，所以无无限归约。该论证覆盖含变量项，而不仅是地面项。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-355","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-disjoint-union-reduction-cycle.md]]"}],"outgoing":["69109041e60f84f6","707725c5abd5d9ca"]}